  * V.01-04ECO02: the maintainer scripts handle the service as
    dh_installsystemd does: remove keeps the unit enabled, purge removes
    its links, abort-remove starts it again, an upgrade restarts an enabled
    unit even when it is stopped; a failure of systemd never fails the
    installation or the removal. No code change.

